Package: acerctl
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: FnnDK <fernando.resende.k@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), dbus, polkitd | policykit-1, systemd, udev
Recommends: acerctl-dkms
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/FnnDK/acerctl
Description: daemon and CLI for the firmware features of Acer laptops
 acerd exposes the firmware features of Acer laptops (operating modes, fans,
 keyboard backlight, USB charging, battery charge limit and calibration, RGB
 lighting where present) over D-Bus, next to the in-tree acer_wmi driver;
 acerctl is its command-line client. Each feature appears only when the
 firmware offers it.
